    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJ1bQvehlIyUwR70xHj7W_4U0",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Asad Akash",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118151236033165368480/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKp6oIgwNrD1V8eqclmlTKMc2pm1I2rd0a80dOO7aVX2WbMY8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This store alone made my trip to Montreal enjoyable 10x. They staff was so kind a friendly/helpful. I came in a few minutes before closing and they were very accommodating for me to try my first poutine. Excellent service and food. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1753796090,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jay Webber",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107758525939618039911/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOT63Ji-_GyL4Bp40DS1BwOEbIkOjIcUUkGNvTpo69C_CRTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Great fried food. Poutine is tasty and of high quality.\nHot dogs are great, also lots of different options. Hamburgers are excellent. Staff is always friendly and very quick, interior is clean and often cleaned.",
        "time": 1767563029,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Zachary Zandona",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110650666882359613575/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNo6w0h13mkDBW0s7wda-v0RDhi8GwPD1H_wUZGo3xpsKd9lVcZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Amazing authentic place to stop for poutine on your way in/out of Montreal. The fries, gravy, and cheese curds all tasted very good and they had a wide variety of poutines to choose from. Staff were friendly and it’s very cheap. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1736097028,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sara Olympia Smyk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100991846885513763368/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIvVaNpuflnVqYn2eZj6oooCyYc3D3NDV5yodhTZX4B2ZfGpw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "This place is amazing! All the food is 100/10! The staff makes you feel so welcomed and appreciated. I walk in and they already know my order! That’s just how la fritte à Brigitte is! My favourite thing to get is a cheeseburger and that young man, Alec, makes the best one I’ve ever tried.",
        "time": 1759290651,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lara Stagljar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108519293841792727953/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxam56gNGW9UCfHxJmd-NAoMUfG4YMjEJN85hQShgxX5BgATRb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The poutine is good, but the cheeseburger. Just wow. It tastes like what I imagine a burger used to taste like in the 1950s when food actually had taste. The meat is so flavourful, lettuce crispy… we  ordered another one 😂",
        "time": 1735416047,
        "translated": false
